16.2.1 not: query
-----------------

*'not:QUERY'*
You can prepend *'not:'* to a query to negate the match.
Eg: 'not:equity', 'not:desc:apple'
(Also, a trick: 'not:not:...' can sometimes solve query problems
conveniently.)


