Start the REPL and enter some commands:

$ hledger repl 
hledger 1.52
Enter hledger commands. To exit, enter 'quit' or 'exit', or send EOF / control-d.
2025> stats
Main file           : .../2025.journal
...
2025> stats -f 2024/2024.journal 
